## 9.3 Reconnect Logic (LOCK)

WiFi:

- Retry every 5s

MQTT:

- Retry every 3s
- Do not block main loop
- After reconnect → resubscribe

Implement in `drv_mqtt_client::ensure_connect_()` (sudah ada).

Tambahkan resubscribe after connect:

```cpp
if (ok) {
  cli_.subscribe("htl/site-01/command/+");
