## 9.4 Server Lifecycle

Server service (controller_mqtt_ingestion.py):

```
START
 ↓
CONNECT MQTT
 ↓
SUBSCRIBE telemetry + health
 ↓
WAIT LOOP
 ↓
WRITE SQLite
```

If broker down:

- client.loop() handles reconnect
- no blocking sleep >1s

---

## 9.5 End-to-End Command Flow

1. CLI publish command → `htl/site-01/command/node01`
2. Gateway receive → forward to DEV-HTL-02 boundary
3. Node execute → send ACK (radio)
4. Gateway publish ACK → `htl/site-01/ack/node01`
5. Server receive → mark command_log

