## 9.6 Buffer Flush Policy (LOCK)

- Max flush 10 message per loop
- If publish fail → push back
- Drop oldest if buffer full
- Buffer capacity: 50 message

---

## 9.7 Degraded Mode

If:

- WiFi down
- MQTT down

Then:

- Only buffer
- Publish health locally only
- Do not crash
- Recover automatically

